  "text": "proprium.commemoratio-omnium-fidelium-defunctorum-missa-i-communio",
  "about": "The communio of the formulary “Commemoration of All the Faithful Departed — Mass I” in the 1962 Roman Missal.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": {
      "translation": "May light eternal shine upon them, O Lord, with Your Saints forever, for You are kind. Grant them eternal rest, O Lord; and let perpetual light shine upon them: with Your Saints forever, for You are kind."
    }
  },
